# Run the document_a11y fixture server, port configurable through the environment.
settle 30
key escape
open gemini://127.0.0.1:${TURNSTONE_A11Y_GEMINI_PORT}/capsule.gmi
settle 60
act Toggle live content
settle 30
assert content-live
assert a11y link: First Gemini >> link: Second Gemini
capture gemini_document_a11y
